       }
      ],
      "text": "Bruit sites (rule of 2):"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " listen w the bell over the aorta and the renal, iliac and femoral arteries; renal arteries are 2 in above and 2 in lat to the umbilicus, iliac arteries 2 in below and 2 in lat."
     }
    ]
   },
